  "worked_solution": "Let's write the equation of the line as\n\n$$\nr=⟨5+3t,3-t,-2+2t⟩.\n$$\n\nNow, substituting $r=⟨5+3t,3-t,-2+2t⟩$ into the equation of the plane, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot ⟨-2,4,5⟩ & =8 \\\\ ⟨5-3t,3-t,-2+2t⟩\\cdot ⟨-2,4,5⟩ & =8 \\\\ -2(5+3t)+4(3-t)+5\\cdot (-2+2t) & =8 \\\\ -10-6t+12-4t-10+10t & =8 \\\\ -8 & =8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation has no solution. Therefore, we conclude that the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ do not intersect.",
